{"id":"desagradable","lemma":"desagradable","pos":"adj","rank":1814,"glosses":["unpleasant, disagreeable, distasteful, off-putting, displeasing, unpleasing, bad, rude, unsavory, uncomfortable, unlikable, objectionable, painful, uncongenial, crappy, gnarly (US slang)","nasty, ugly, unkind, objectionable, unsightly (e.g., person, behavior)"],"ipa":"/desaɡɾaˈdable/","forms":{"femininePlural":"desagradables"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a5/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-desagradable.wav","examples":[{"text":"¡Qué desagradable sorpresa!","en":"What an unpleasant surprise!","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/600210","words":[{"g":"what"},null,{"g":"surprise"}]},{"text":"La situación es desagradable.","en":"The situation is ugly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/301851","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"situation"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"Tom es una de las personas más desagradables que conozco.","en":"Tom is one of the most disagreeable people I know.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/801813","words":[null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"person (an individual","l":"persona"},{"g":"more"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"to know","l":"conocer"}]},{"text":"El olor era desagradable.","en":"The smell was offensive.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/705453","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"smell, scent, odor"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"Lo que sucedió después fue desagradable.","en":"What followed was unpleasant.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/937822","words":[null,null,{"g":"to happen","l":"suceder"},{"g":"later"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"what, that which"]]}]}